 },
 "equipment": {
  "_comment": "Equipment slots, in screen order. accepts = item slot types (bases' 'slot') that fit; the first one is the slot's own type, used when equipping with a double-click. offhand also takes a one-hand weapon: two weapons alternate their swings, but there is no guard and no Shield skills without a shield.",
